  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Quality of Early Years Reading Instructions in Ethiopia and South Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the project supported is improving quality in education for primary grades in Ethiuopian schools through heightening the competence of TTCs and HEI in Ethiopia and South Sudan in early reading instructions. This is an agreement between Norad and the Addis Ababa University (AAU) as agreement partner, Bahir Dar University (BDU), University of Juba (UoJ) and Oslo and Akershus University College of Applied Sciences (HiOA) as the Norwegian partner Institution.</narrative>
  </description>
